# Vercel Web Analytics (Cursor mirror of rules/13-vercel-analytics.md)

> Canonical source: `rules/13-vercel-analytics.md`.

- Install: `npm install @vercel/analytics`
- Verify types before coding: `cat node_modules/@vercel/analytics/dist/react/index.d.ts`
- Import `Analytics` from `@vercel/analytics/react` and mount **only** after explicit user consent (`accept` vs `reject` of equal prominence).
- Keep PII out of URLs/events (`beforeSend`) and enable Web Analytics in the Vercel dashboard.
